  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 3,
  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;digit numbers be constructed using the digits <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn></math>&nbsp;with repetition allowed, and are arranged in ascending order with serial numbers. Then the serial number of the number <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>42923</mn></math> is _____ .",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2997",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Number of five-digit numbers formed using the digits&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>9</mn></math>&nbsp;with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;at&nbsp;the first place is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1296</mn></math></p><p>Since,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><munder><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></munder><munder><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></munder><munder><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></munder><munder><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></munder><mo>=</mo><mn>1296</mn></math></p><p>Number of five-digit numbers formed using the given digits with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;at&nbsp;the first place is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1296</mn></math></p><p>Since,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><munder><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></munder><munder><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></munder><munder><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></munder><munder><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></munder><mo>=</mo><mn>1296</mn></math></p><p>Number of five-digit numbers formed using the given digits with&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>40</mn></math>&nbsp;at&nbsp;the first place is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>216</mn></math></p><p>Since,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>40</mn><munder><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></munder><munder><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></munder><munder><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></munder><mo>=</mo><mn>216</mn></math></p><p>And,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>420</mn><munder><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></munder><munder><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></munder><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><menclose notation=\"bottom\"><mn>4</mn></menclose><mo>&#160;</mo><menclose notation=\"bottom\"><mn>2</mn></menclose><mo>&#160;</mo><menclose notation=\"bottom\"><mn>2</mn></menclose><munder><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></munder><munder><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></munder><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>423</mn><munder><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></munder><munder><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></munder><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>424</mn><munder><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></munder><munder><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></munder><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>427</mn><munder><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></munder><munder><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></munder><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>429</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><menclose notation=\"bottom\"><mn>0</mn></menclose><munder><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></munder><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>429</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>429</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>429</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Required serial number is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1296</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>216</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2997</mn></math></p>",
